{
  "artifact_profile": "l2_standard",
  "description": "Runs a fixture-backed Web-platform semantics probe for IndexedDB index query. The driver reads output from the self-hosted fixture `/fixtures/l2_round3/dB_m_idb_index.html`, and the server-side grader compares it with the checked-in expected answer. Current probe details: IDB async; PENDING pattern; output 'BOOKS=2:T1,BOOKMATCH_T3'.",
